### 1. Create a new student (POST endpoint)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Quiros",
  "email": "carlos@example.com"
}

### 2. Get the list of students (GET endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### 3. Rick and Morty: all locations (fills the second select)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rickandmorty/locations

### 4. Rick and Morty: all episodes (fills the second select)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rickandmorty/episodes

### 5. Rick and Morty: residents of a location (nested endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rickandmorty/locations/1/residents

### 6. Rick and Morty: characters of an episode (nested endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rickandmorty/episodes/1/characters

### 7. Rick and Morty: search characters by name (debounced search)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rickandmorty/characters?name=rick
